# Keep the scorer image small. Only the runtime bits and the source tree
# need to land in /app; training, notebooks, .venv, local checkpoints, etc.
# all stay on the build host.
#
# ONNX weights, JSON model cards and the interest vocabulary are pulled
# from the GitHub release at build time (see Dockerfile.scorer), not from
# the build context — that's why these patterns are not whitelisted.
*
*/*/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/**
!scripts
!scripts/match_scorer_server.py
!scripts/interest_matcher_server.py
!scripts/run_servers.py
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# whitelisting each file (not the directory) keeps __pycache__ out
!src/just_mate_ml/models/interest_matcher.py
!src/just_mate_ml/data/embed.py
!src/just_mate_ml/data/__init__.py